{"sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","items":[{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k001","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"Arrhenius 식 k=Ae^(−Ea/RT)은 온도와 속도상수 관계를 나타낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k002","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"ln k 대 1/T 그래프 기울기는 −Ea/R이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k003","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"두 온도 사이 ln(k₂/k₁)=−Ea/R(1/T₂−1/T₁)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k004","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"전이상태는 반응좌표에서 에너지 장벽 꼭대기의 상태이며 중간체는 단계 사이의 상대적 에너지 최소점이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k005","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"반응속도는 활성화 장벽과 충돌·배향 및 반응 경로에 영향을 받는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k006","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"단일 기본반응의 속도식은 분자도와 연결된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k007","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"다단계 기작에서는 느린 단계 근사, 빠른 전평형, 정상상태 근사 등을 사용해 중간체를 제거한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k008","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"촉매는 다른 경로를 제공하여 활성화 자유에너지를 낮추며 순반응에서 재생된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k009","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"정반응과 역반응의 평형상수를 바꾸지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k010","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"균일촉매는 반응물과 같은 상, 불균일촉매는 다른 상에 존재하며 흡착과 표면 반응이 중요할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k011","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"촉매는 활성화 장벽을 낮추지만 반응 ΔG나 ΔH를 바꾸지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k012","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"중간체는 생성 후 소모, 촉매는 소모 후 재생되는 전형적 패턴.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k013","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"정상상태 근사는 중간체 생성·소모 속도의 균형이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k014","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"반응차수는 기작의 가능성을 평가하지만 단독으로 기작을 확정하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--mechanism-k015","sectionId":"kinetics/mechanism","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"약 49.9 kJ/mol이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}